@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "前台" as A0
boundary "<u>:前台接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:维护预约及接诊</u>\n<u>安排控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:预约</u>" as Appointment
participant "<u>:日期安排</u>" as Schedule
participant "<u>:接诊占用</u>" as Occupancy
participant "<u>:预约变更</u>" as AppointmentChange
participant "<u>:诊后要求</u>" as Followup
participant "工作单元" as W
participant "数据映射器" as DM
participant "权限与会话服务" as AUTH
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-01办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 办理(ctx, UC01Command)
activate K
group 本阶段同一写事务
K -> W : 开始写事务()
W --> K : 同一连接
K -> AUTH : 核对岗位及对象(ctx, 引用)
AUTH --> K : 有效授权依据或拒绝
K -> W : 核对提交(ctx, cmd)
W --> K : 新命令分支（原结果短路见公共图）
K -> DM : 装载(对象引用、连接)
DM --> K : 实体与依据快照
K -> Appointment : 核对可变更性(预约及当前版本)
activate Appointment
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
K -> Schedule : 重新安排或释放(改约目标或取消)
activate Schedule
Schedule -> Occupancy : 调整有效占用(患者、牙医、诊椅)
activate Occupancy
Occupancy --> Schedule : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Occupancy
Schedule --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Schedule
K -> Appointment : 变更或取消安排(原因及新占用)
activate Appointment
Appointment -> AppointmentChange : 保留变更(原安排与办理依据)
activate AppointmentChange
AppointmentChange --> Appointment : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate AppointmentChange
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
opt 取消的预约关联诊后要求
K -> Followup : 恢复待安排(取消的复诊预约)
activate Followup
Followup --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Followup
end
alt 本阶段全部校验通过
K -> DM : 保存(变更集合、连接)
DM --> K : 保存成功或版本冲突
K -> W : 校验集合与来源()
W --> K : 末校验结果
K -> W : 保存结果与审计并提交()
else 任一步骤拒绝或保存失败
K -> W : 回滚()
end
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Followup
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
